-- Chapter 1, Articles 4 to 11: information and disclosure, misstatement of age, the
-- incontestability period, currency, Beneficiaries, changes, and adding or removing an
-- Insured Member. Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of
-- ../../source/raw/manulife-group-linked.txt.

§ `Articles 4 to 11`

§§ `Refusals this module gives`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the document does not say how deductions are shared between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` MEANS
    REFUSE "the document does not say how Debt, charges and other deductions are shared between the Policyholder's and the Insured Member's payments"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`6.2 gives no floor when the deductions exceed the amount refunded` MEANS
    REFUSE "6.2 gives no floor when the deductions exceed the amount refunded"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`10.2 gives no floor when the deductions exceed the amount paid` MEANS
    REFUSE "10.2 gives no floor when the deductions exceed the amount paid"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Article 5 does not provide for this breach` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 5 provides for a deliberate breach the Company would have declined (5.2) and a breach that did not affect the decision (5.3), and for nothing else"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`9.3 does not provide for a Beneficiary who dies at the same moment as the Insured Member` MEANS
    REFUSE "9.3 does not provide for a Beneficiary who dies at the same moment as the Insured Member"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`9.3 does not say how shares are fixed when only some Beneficiaries have one` MEANS
    REFUSE "9.3 does not say how shares are fixed when only some Beneficiaries have a specified share"

§ `Article 4 — the Company's duty to inform and to keep information confidential`
-- src:321 | ĐIỀU 4  NGHĨA VỤ CUNG CẤP VÀ
-- src:322 | BẢO MẬT THÔNG TIN CỦA CÔNG TY

§§ `Article 4.1 — false information from the Company`

-- The duty itself (to give full information and explain the terms) has no deadline and no
-- measure in the document: carried as text. The consequence of false information is a right
-- of the Policyholder to terminate and to a refund of "all premium paid, less Account Value
-- withdrawals and Debt (if any)".
-- src:325-329 | Khi giao kết Hợp Đồng, Công Ty có trách nhiệm tự mình…
-- src:333-337 | Hiểm. Trong trường hợp Công Ty cung cấp thông tin sai…
@ref Article 4.1 (src:333-337)
GIVEN `the Company gave false information to conclude the Contract` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`4.1 — the Policyholder may terminate the Contract unilaterally` `the Company gave false information to conclude the Contract` MEANS
    `the Company gave false information to conclude the Contract`

@ref Article 4.1 (src:333-337); compare the Law, Art 22(3) (fork F25)
GIVEN r IS A `A refund under Article 4.1`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`4.1 — the refund` r MEANS
    r's `total premium paid` MINUS r's `account value withdrawals` MINUS r's `debt`

§§ `Article 4.2 — transfer of personal information`

-- src:338 | Công Ty không được chuyển giao thông tin cá nhân do
-- src:339 | Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm/Người Được Bảo Hiểm cung cấp cho
-- src:340 | bất kỳ bên thứ ba nào khác, trừ các trường hợp sau đây:
-- src:341-349 | a) Thu thập, sử dụng, chuyển giao theo yêu cầu của cơ…
-- src:350-359 | b) Các trường hợp khác được Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm/Người…
@ref Article 4.2 (src:338-359)
GIVEN t IS A `A transfer of personal information`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`4.2 — the Company may transfer the information to a third party` t MEANS
        "a)" ... (t's `at the request of a competent state authority` OR t's `for a purpose listed in 4.2(a)`)
    OR  "b)" ... t's `consented to in writing by the Policyholder or the Insured Member`
             ... t's `the person was told the purpose and given the choice to consent or not`

